+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+"""Draft-graph bookkeeping on CPU; no vLLM package, CUDA, server or network.
+
+The fake CUDA runner records copy operations and a small fake model callable.
+The native metadata builder/cache supplies the plans. CPU tensors
+stand in for device buffers by field role in the capture fixture; the separate
+device_plan_copies test checks actual device selection with tagged stand-ins.
+This establishes capture/replay ordering and host-read-free Python bookkeeping,
+not CUDA capture safety, model correctness or performance on a GPU.
+"""
