+"""CPU gates for dense LoRA math, row isolation, and stream enqueue ordering.
+
+The independent oracle models Punica's shrink/expand rounding: FP32 shrink,
+cast to B dtype, expand rounded to B dtype before addition. CUDA Punica itself
+cannot run on CPU. These tests do not establish GPU equality or capture safety.
+"""
